sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Uni as University staff
  participant UI as University portal (browser)
  participant MM as MetaMask
  participant SC as CertificateRegistry (Sepolia)
  Uni->>UI: Enter student name, roll no, degree, CGPA, year
  Uni->>UI: Attach degree PDF
  UI->>UI: SHA-256(file) computed locally
  Note over UI: The PDF never leaves the computer.<br/>Only the 32-byte hash is used.
  UI->>MM: issueCertificate(details, documentHash)
  MM->>Uni: Ask to confirm transaction
  Uni->>MM: Confirm
  MM->>SC: Signed transaction
  SC->>SC: Check active university,<br/>non-empty fields, hash not used before
  SC-->>UI: CertificateIssued(certId, issuer, documentHash)
  UI->>SC: verifyCertificate(certId)
  SC-->>UI: Stored record
  UI-->>Uni: Certificate card with ID and QR code
